WEBVTT

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:31.920
Look, everyone! Whooper swans!

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:34.610
They must be migrating!

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:37.880
Oh, how wonderful!

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:40.640
So this is how the world 
looks to a bird's eyes!

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:48.060
We're even higher than the clouds now!

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:51.980
If we go even higher, close to outer space...

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:55.980
I'm sure I'll understand how the stars feel!

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.490
<i>How many more times...</i>

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:04.260
<i>How many more times will I be 
able to fly with all of them?</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.140
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:20.140
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:35.150
BURANKI

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:38.820
BURANKI

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:42.620
BURANKI

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:02.510
Kazuki

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:02.510
Kaoruko

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:33.420
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:33.420
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.000
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.000
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:43.280
Your wish will never come true 
if you keep running away,

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:44.590
Laetitia!

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:46.010
Weren't you going to earn Guy's approval

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:48.840
and get yourself an immortal body?

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:59.210
It's about time for the sickly princess 
to step off the stage, Laetitia!

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:09.940
Laetitia-sama! Into the sky!

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:10.500
Right!

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:16.000
You're not getting away!

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:31.310
I figured you'd do that!

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.990
Now to make doubly sure that worked!

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:53.420
Yay!

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:58.360
Your little sister's not half bad.

00:03:58.360 --> 00:03:58.920
Yeah.

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:08.180
Huh? You guys still wanna fight?

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:15.010
Laetitia-sama, please stay here and rest.

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:17.190
Moses...

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:20.690
The four of you intend to fight on your own?

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:30.330
We limbs are here

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:33.490
for the purpose of protecting you!

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:45.390
This is the power born when 
Righty-chan and I become as one...

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:48.800
This is Righty-chan's new form...

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:52.800
Th-That's way too intense!

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:57.940
You'll go back to being normal Righty-chan 
when the fight's over, right?!

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:10.990
How do you like the way the 
new Himekiri and Hoemaru cut?!

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:12.290
Damn you!

00:05:12.690 --> 00:05:13.830
Boom.

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:22.130
Surely that wasn't enough to beat him.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:27.680
Hey! Your name was Justin, right?

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:30.350
That Guy bastard is just using you!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:32.080
Open your eyes!

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:33.350
Wake up.

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:37.350
I'm well aware of what Guy is after.

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:38.690
What?

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:43.390
To wipe the evil beings called 
Buranki from the face of the Earth?

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:47.110
That's just a means to keep 
his organization running.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.570
No more than a facade.

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:51.700
Guy hopes to take over the world

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:54.580
with the power of the Buranki's progenitor.

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:58.080
If you know that, why do you do his bidding?

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:03.590
I'm only letting him use me 
so I can stab him in the back.

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:08.470
So that I can become the king 
of the new world instead of him!

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:09.870
The king?

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:11.760
He's lost his mind.

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:15.870
Do you think you can keep 
running away forever?

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:19.970
Now, you four! Get to work 
for your future king!

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:31.740
It's acting weird...

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:34.830
What's the meaning of this, Angus?

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:37.730
Forget it.

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:44.000
M-My body's...

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:45.170
What is this?

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:48.510
I've forcefully taken control of you limbs,

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:52.090
using the new power that Guy gave to me!

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:10.900
Within the earth is where little bugs belong.

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:12.960
Damn it...

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:14.620
How is it so fast?

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:23.580
Take this!

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:25.380
Laughable!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.620
Thanks, Shizuru-kun.

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:44.810
Nod.

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:56.490
You incompetent fools.

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:06.710
Damn, you never give up.

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:09.420
What is the deal with you guys, anyway?

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:12.960
You can't beat a Buranki with just Bubuki!

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:14.430
Are you all insane?

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:19.430
I refuse!

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:22.240
Become the limb of a Buranki, you say?

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:25.050
I have no obligation to offer 
up my life for another!

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:26.990
You would defy your master?!

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:29.120
You're no more than a dog bought with money!

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:33.120
Why do all of you do as that girl says?!

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:37.120
You were all bought with money, too!

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.120
What did you say?

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.890
Please forgive my father's rude behavior.

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:04.300
You only just came to our home, and he's 
already made it unpleasant for you.

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:05.790
I'm very sorry.

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:11.200
When I'm in the Buranki, I can 
move freely, of my own will.

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:13.650
That's how my father thinks.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:17.100
He brought us all here just for that?

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:19.160
What a disgustingly doting father.

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:21.660
I agree with you.

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:24.820
But even if it's just for a little while,

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:28.170
couldn't you try to humor my selfish whims?

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:34.120
I want to use the Buranki to eliminate the

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:37.390
so-called headless Buranki 
that threaten this world,

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:41.390
so I can protect this country's 
peace and the beauty of its nature.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:46.440
So a princess in a wheelchair 
wants to play the hero of justice?

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:50.120
That's too dangerous a game 
for someone so wealthy.

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:51.190
I refuse.

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:56.190
I truly apologize for forcing 
you to humor my selfish whims.

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.200
Huh?

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:01.200
I never said I'd humor your whims in any way!

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:05.500
Oh... Come to think of it, you're right.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:15.050
Regardless, it won't be for very long.

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:20.540
You're one strange girl.

00:10:21.940 --> 00:10:23.500
Strange? Am I?

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:27.020
I wouldn't know, myself.

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:35.530
You don't need to worry.

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:39.610
A day like this would 
make anyone feel drowsy.

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:41.780
That's just how humans are.

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:49.000
<b>Episode 20
 The Rebellious Limb</b>

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:49.000
<b><i>The Gentle Giants
 of the Galaxy</i></b>

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:53.500
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.520
Ow, ow, ow...

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:07.600
Damn you!

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:22.600
That was way too close...

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:24.570
What is with these guys?

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:28.410
Kaoruko, fall back! There's no end to this!

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:30.250
Y-You're right.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:32.620
I don't think we can keep this up.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.600
Demokratia?

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:43.340
What's going on?

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:55.240
This is amazing!

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:57.150
Maximum gulp!

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:58.400
Well, go on.

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:01.600
Eat to your hearts' content.

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:02.780
Monsieur Guy.

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:07.120
However you choose to punish 
us for leaving the front line,

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.790
we will humbly accept it.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:12.300
Punish you? Whatever do you mean, Luis?

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:15.310
In any case, we can discuss 
difficult matters later.

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:18.670
Eat up, before the food gets cold.

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:20.360
Right...

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:22.330
To not eat a meal offered to you is shameful!

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:23.710
Let's dig in!

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:25.050
Let's dig, dig in!

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:27.050
Yahoo!

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.450
Meat! Meat! Meat! Meat!

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:30.490
This ro-ro-ro-ro-rocks!

00:12:32.110 --> 00:12:34.060
Hey, you guys...

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:41.660
By the way, Epizo,

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:44.280
how do you feel about Laetitia?

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:47.280
Huh? What do you mean?

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:51.330
I'm asking you how you feel 
about the girl named Laetitia.

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:55.330
That girl... Laetitia is trying hard.

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:59.550
For her goals, for her dreams...

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:00.840
I think she's admirable.

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:03.610
Hmm... Is she?

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:07.340
It seems you and I simply don't agree.

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:13.060
I've decided to remove Laetitia and the 
England team from the Buranki Epimew.

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:15.390
What?! What did you say?!

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:19.900
Then what will happen to Laetitia's 
goal of becoming Entei's pilot?

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.900
What about her dream of being healed 
and walking on her own two feet?!

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:28.700
People should stick to realistic dreams.

00:13:29.250 --> 00:13:31.710
Laetitia will spend her remaining time

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:34.700
living quietly in her homeland, I suppose.

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:36.430
No way.

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:39.420
No matter what the reason, 
that's just too much!

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:41.240
I would like you five

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:45.160
to strike down the Argo 
Gaura and the Buranki Oubu.

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:50.140
Also, I'd appreciate it if you 
could eliminate Oubu's heart user.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:53.220
Azuma?! You want us to kill Azuma?!

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:59.230
We'll say that will cancel out all 
the mistakes you've made thus far.

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:04.380
Monsieur Guy, if I defeat Azuma and Oubu,

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:07.130
will you heal Laetitia?

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:10.240
Are you speaking of the regenerative ability

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:12.660
she would gain by becoming Entei's heart?

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:14.300
That's right! Yes!

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:20.050
But Epizo, why are you so concerned 
with what happens to Laetitia?

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:24.460
Uh... Well, I mean... How do I put it?

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:28.050
Epizo, this is what you should 
say at a time like this!

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:30.680
"Because Laetitia is very important to me!"

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:31.180
Like that.

00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:33.720
Oh! Thank you, Domina!

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:38.690
Monsieur Guy, it's because 
Laetitia is very important to me!

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:40.660
Bravo!

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:45.490
Epizo, you're saying you will 
fight for the girl you love?

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:47.190
How truly wonderful!

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:49.500
Oh, I wouldn't go that far...

00:14:50.520 --> 00:14:52.840
But, unfortunately,

00:14:52.840 --> 00:14:55.650
we've discovered that 
no one but Banryuu Reoko

00:14:55.650 --> 00:14:58.830
was capable of gaining an 
immortal heart from Entei.

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.660
Huh? What did you say?

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:05.140
But we've also found that, by breaking 
the heart and entering a Buranki's brain,

00:15:05.140 --> 00:15:08.170
one can experience the same effects.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:11.330
But entering a Buranki's brain...

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:14.180
Isn't that dangerous?

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:17.200
"Nothing ventured, nothing gained."

00:15:17.820 --> 00:15:21.020
All things come with risks, Epizo.

00:15:21.590 --> 00:15:23.340
R-Right...

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:27.500
Epizo, out of consideration to you,

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:30.570
I will return the Buranki Epimew to Laetitia.

00:15:32.010 --> 00:15:36.580
You should talk to Laetitia 
before heading off to battle.

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:43.580
I'm quite eager to know

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:48.340
what a Buranki would think 
after getting its brain back.

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:52.840
<i>Pardon me, master.</i>

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:54.400
What is it?

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:59.610
<i>There's someone here who wishes 
to speak with you in person.</i>

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:02.130
Who is it?

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:06.800
Hey, Epizo...

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:09.730
You don't really intend to 
kill Kazuki Azuma, do you?

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:16.630
Laetitia...

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:19.580
<i>Epizo? Is that you, Epizo?</i>

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:22.320
Are you all right?

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:25.080
They're not keeping you locked up 
in some confined space, are they?

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:28.000
No, I'm just fine.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:31.900
But why are you calling me? 
Where are you right now?

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:33.590
<i>You don't have to worry about a thing.</i>

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:36.370
<i>I'll get you out of there in no time.</i>

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:39.030
<i>So just wait a bit longer.</i>

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:42.070
Thank you, Epizo.

00:16:42.070 --> 00:16:45.730
I'm sorry to ask, but when you do, 
can Moses and the others also...

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.730
Of course, I'll get them out, too.

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:51.740
Thank you.

00:16:53.130 --> 00:17:00.000
I'm pretty stupid, so I don't know much 
about stuff like Buranki and the world.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.870
But I will fight for you.

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:08.380
<i>So that you can walk on 
your own feet someday.</i>

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:09.800
Epizo...

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:12.230
Thank you.

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:14.130
Please be careful as well.

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:17.030
I will. Later.

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.440
Hey!

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:32.690
A-chan! Welcome back!

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:34.510
Kogane-chan!

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:36.280
Jeez, I'm all sticky with sweat.

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:38.720
I could really use a bath right now.

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:45.480
I've got Justin's Batolov on me now?

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:47.290
What the heck is up with today?!

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:51.920
Kaoruko, I'll strike down 
both you and your brother!

00:17:54.110 --> 00:17:55.160
Everyone!

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:57.090
We gotta combine!

00:17:57.310 --> 00:17:58.330
Yeah!

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:08.600
You little...

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:14.310
Azuma!

00:18:14.310 --> 00:18:15.030
A-chan!

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:18.400
Azuma, his attacks are too 
fast to follow with our eyes!

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:21.200
He's using the heart to 
control the limbs by force!

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:23.580
If you do that...

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:26.580
It puts immense strain on the limbs.

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:27.960
In that case...

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:39.600
If all you do is force all the 
suffering onto your limbs,

00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:42.060
you have no right to act as a heart!

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:44.720
I'm through letting you talk.

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:48.270
I'll show you brats the 
true power of Justin Lion!

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:00.550
What was that?

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:02.660
What the heck just happened?

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:12.790
Hey! What the hell are you four thinking?

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:14.640
Justin, I'm sorry,

00:19:14.640 --> 00:19:18.650
but we've decided that we won't look 
at you as our heart any longer.

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:22.000
We've had it with being your limbs.

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:24.470
Do your best to get by alone, Mr. King.

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:30.660
You do that, and I guarantee Guy's 
going to wipe out all four of you.

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:32.480
Just like Maxim's team.

00:19:32.760 --> 00:19:34.630
Then we'll fight.

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:36.480
Even against Guy.

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:44.200
Hah! You'll fight, will you?

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:46.860
What exactly do you think 
four limbs alone can do?

00:19:46.860 --> 00:19:49.230
In the end, you'll realize 
your own powerlessness

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:52.580
and come crawling back to 
me, crying like babies.

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:57.090
You guys!

00:19:58.330 --> 00:19:59.710
Welcome back.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:03.760
Thanks.

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:06.350
Thanks!

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:11.170
Now that we've succeeded in 
rescuing Reoko-sama and Kaoruko,

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:13.320
we're going back to Japan for now,

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:16.810
and once we've regrouped, we'll go after Guy.

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:20.340
Since Guy is trying to get 
his hands on Treasure Island,

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:23.490
he's sure to show up in 
Japanese waters eventually.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:25.870
Okay, Matobai-san.

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.920
This is pretty good!

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:38.020
Kaoruko-chan, I'm so glad 
you made it back safely!

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:40.110
It was a piece of cake.

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:42.060
Yeah, you're one to talk.

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:43.360
Oh, shut up!

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:44.080
What?!

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:45.520
What, yourself?!

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:48.860
The Kazuki twins fight 
because they're so close.

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:50.010
That's not why!

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:54.810
Hey, Shuusaku, aren't you being a bit cold?

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:55.370
Huh?

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:59.040
You didn't have to keep us in the dark, too!

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:01.800
Is your baby a boy or a girl?

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:03.530
If you'd said something beforehand, we 
could've at least been of some help!

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:03.530
Did you have your wedding ceremony?

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:06.650
What's with you guys all of a sudden?

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:06.650
Are you listening?!

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:09.350
Is it that woman you told me about before?

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:09.350
How old is the mother? How old is she?!

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:12.020
Was she a CA? Or was it an AD?

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:12.200
Is she in her thirties? Her twenties?

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:15.670
She's not a teenager, is she?!

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:15.670
What the heck?! That's not fair!
That's so not fair!

00:21:16.140 --> 00:21:17.210
For cryin' out loud...

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:22.130
You won't get away with 
snagging someone before me!

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:29.980
Anyway, A-chan, it's great that you 
were able to save Kaoruko-chan.

00:21:29.980 --> 00:21:32.560
Yeah. It was thanks to you, Kogane-chan.

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:33.640
Thanks.

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:35.350
I'm sorry!

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:36.960
That's not true.

00:21:38.280 --> 00:21:44.090
Kogane, you look best when you're smiling.

00:21:44.090 --> 00:21:44.990
I'll kill you!

00:21:58.630 --> 00:21:59.790
I never thought

00:22:00.330 --> 00:22:03.920
the day would come when 
I'd meet you in person.
